摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Manage DeepSeek Harness profiles — list, create, clone, diff, and share a whole dsh setup as one portable file.","id":"gh:1333436594","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dshp","slug":"asdf17128/dshp","topics":["cli","deepseek","deepseek-harness","devtools","dsh","dsh-plugin","profile-manager"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Manage DeepSeek Harness profiles — list, create, clone, diff, and share a whole dsh setup as one por"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"Seek Harness profiles — list, create, clone, diff, and share a whole dsh setup as one portable file."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dshp"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Hand your whole dsh setup to someone as one file — and they get the exact same tree.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Shows every profile on your machine in one line each. Read-only, zero dependencies."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## What it gives you"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"**See what you actually have.** `dshp ls` and `dshp show` answer \"what is\ninstalled, in what order, "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"and did I patch it\" without opening a single file."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"**Copy before you break it.** `dshp clone web web-test` duplicates a working\nsetup in under a second"},{"id":"p9s2","text":", `node_modules` and all. Experiment on the copy; `rm`\nit when done."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"**Share a setup that reproduces exactly.** `dshp export` writes bundle order,\nplugin versions and yo"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ur patch into one short file. `dshp import` rebuilds it —\nverified: a 132-entry profile reproduced i"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"nto a fresh `$DSH_HOME` composes an\nidentical tree, patch included."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"dsh itself can boot a profile and forward installs to pnpm, but it cannot create\nan empty one, list "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"what you have, or copy a working setup before you experiment\non it. That is all manual work under `~"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"/.dsh/profiles` today."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Share a setup"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Short enough to paste into a forum post. On the other machine:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"That writes the profile, installs the plugins through dsh's own pnpm, and you boot it with `dsh --pr"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ofile web`. Verified end-to-end: a fresh `$DSH_HOME` reproduced a 132-entry tree identical to the or"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"iginal, patch included."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Experiment safely"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"If it goes wrong, `dshp rm web-试验田 --yes`. Your working profile was never touched."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Commands"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| `dshp ls` | profiles, with bundle/plugin counts and disk size |\n| `dshp show <name>` | bundles in "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"load order, plugins, patch |\n| `dshp new <name> [--web\\|--headless]` | create a profile — dsh itself"},{"id":"p23s3","text":" cannot make an empty one |\n| `dshp clone <from> <to>` | copy a working setup, `node_modules` and al"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"l |\n| `dshp export <name> [-o FILE]` | portable file (stdout by default) |\n| `dshp import <file> [--"},{"id":"p23s5","text":"as NAME] [--no-install]` | recreate a profile |\n| `dshp diff <a> <b>` | what differs |\n| `dshp rm <n"},{"id":"p23s6","text":"ame> --yes` | delete |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## What a profile actually is"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Under `$DSH_HOME/profiles/<name>`:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- `package.json` — `dependencies` are the plugins, `dsh.profile.bundles` is the ordered layer stack\n"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"- `cordis.patch.yml` — your own id-targeted overrides\n- `cordis.yml`, `pnpm-workspace.yaml` — boiler"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"l` — your own id-targeted overrides\n- `cordis.yml`, `pnpm-workspace.yaml` — boilerplate, regenerated"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"So three things reproduce a setup: plugin versions, bundle order, and the patch. That is exactly wha"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"t the portable file carries."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Bundle **order** is part of the format: it decides which layer patches which, so a reordering is rep"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"orted by `diff` as a real difference."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"The patch block is copied byte-for-byte rather than re-serialised, because it may hold `!!js` expres"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"sions (`root: !!js dshHomePath('sessions')`) that a YAML round-trip would mangle or evaluate. Nothin"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"g here ever evaluates your config."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Install and uninstall"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"As a CLI: `npx dshp ls` — nothing to install."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"As a plugin:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Removing it drops the `list_profiles` and `export_profile` tools. Your profiles\nare untouched — the "},{"id":"p34s2","text":"the `list_profiles` and `export_profile` tools. Your profiles\nare untouched — the plugin only reads."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Verified against `@deepseek-ai/dsh` **0.1.0-rc.5**. The profile layout it reads\n(`package.json` with"},{"id":"p36s2","text":" `dsh.profile.bundles`, `cordis.patch.yml`) is dsh's own; a\nchange there is what would break it firs"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"dsh.profile.bundles`, `cordis.patch.yml`) is dsh's own; a\nchange there is what would break it first."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"Node 18+. `import` needs a working `dsh` (local `node_modules/.bin/dsh` preferred, otherwise on `PAT"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"H`) because it installs through dsh's own pnpm; every other command is pure filesystem work."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## See also"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"dsh-doctor — checks a profile for patches that silently stopped applying."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
